---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="DAJC Intelligence - European Heavy Transport Operational Intelligence"
  description="DAJC Intelligence is being built for vehicle-aware European heavy-transport restrictions, change detection, alerts and operational history."
>
  <main class="product-page">
    <p class="eyebrow">DAJC Intelligence</p>
    <h1>Know what changed before it becomes a transport problem.</h1>
    <p class="lead">
      EU Oversize Weekly and the basic Driving Bans Calendar stay public. DAJC Intelligence adds the operational layer:
      saved scope, relevance, change detection, alerts and history.
    </p>

    <div class="status">Early product build · no payment is collected on this page.</div>

    <section class="capabilities" aria-labelledby="capabilities-title">
      <h2 id="capabilities-title">What the paid layer is being built for</h2>
      <div class="grid">
        <article><h3>Saved operating scope</h3><p>Jurisdictions, corridors and operating profiles you use repeatedly.</p></article>
        <article><h3>Vehicle-aware relevance</h3><p>Filter noise using vehicle and transport characteristics instead of country-only alerts.</p></article>
        <article><h3>Change detection</h3><p>Surface what was added, changed, extended, cancelled or newly relevant.</p></article>
        <article><h3>Immediate alerts</h3><p>Operational notifications instead of waiting for the next weekly briefing.</p></article>
        <article><h3>History & evidence</h3><p>See how a maintained rule changed and retain source/provenance context.</p></article>
        <article><h3>Calendar & integrations</h3><p>Advanced feeds and future dispatch/TMS/API hooks with controlled entitlements.</p></article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="free-vs-paid" aria-labelledby="model-title">
      <h2 id="model-title">Free remains useful</h2>
      <div class="columns">
        <div><strong>DAJC.eu Free</strong><p>EU Oversize Weekly, Platform Updates, basic Driving Bans Calendar, demo and public Integration Ecosystem.</p></div>
        <div><strong>DAJC Intelligence</strong><p>Personalisation, change detection, alerts, history and advanced operational feeds. Standalone price has not been announced yet.</p></div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="cta">
      <p class="eyebrow">Early access</p>
      <h2>Want to use Intelligence as it is built?</h2>
      <p>Tell us which countries, corridors and restriction changes matter to your operation.</p>
      <a href="mailto:team@dajc.eu?subject=DAJC%20Intelligence%20Early%20Access">Request early access</a>
    </section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .product-page{position:relative;z-index:2;max-width:1040px;margin:0 auto;padding:8vh 1.5rem 9vh;text-align:center}
  .eyebrow{font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--dajc-orange);margin:0 0 1rem}
  h1{font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;font-size:clamp(2rem,5vw,3.5rem);line-height:1.05;max-width:18ch;margin:0 auto 1rem}
  .lead{max-width:68ch;margin:0 auto;color:var(--dajc-muted);font-size:17px;line-height:1.75}
  .status{display:inline-block;margin:1.5rem auto 3rem;padding:.55rem .85rem;border:1px solid var(--dajc-line);border-radius:999px;color:var(--dajc-muted);font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:11px}
  section{margin-top:4rem}.capabilities h2,.free-vs-paid h2,.cta h2{font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;font-size:clamp(1.4rem,3vw,2rem)}
  .grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:1rem;text-align:left}.grid article,.columns>div{padding:1.3rem;border:1px solid var(--dajc-line);border-radius:12px;background:rgba(0,38,92,.16)}.grid h3{margin:0 0 .5rem;font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif}.grid p,.columns p,.cta p{color:var(--dajc-muted);line-height:1.65;margin:.2rem 0}
  .columns{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:1rem;text-align:left}.columns strong{color:var(--dajc-orange);font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif}
  .cta{padding:2rem;border:1px solid var(--dajc-orange);border-radius:16px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(255,159,0,.08),rgba(0,38,92,.2))}.cta a{display:inline-flex;min-height:44px;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-top:1rem;padding:0 1rem;border-radius:8px;background:var(--dajc-orange);color:var(--dajc-dark);font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;text-decoration:none}
  @media(max-width:760px){.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}}@media(max-width:520px){.grid,.columns{grid-template-columns:1fr}.product-page{padding-left:1rem;padding-right:1rem}}
</style>
